; Please refer to the included README.txt for insights on this version of Aunn.
;CFLAG:1001 - Flag to track, in a non-intrusive way, if the Player is into armpit stuff. Either comes up naturally during Caress or enabled in "Do Nothing" if previously rejected. (0 = not yet encountered, 1 = accepted, 2 = rejected)
;CFLAG:1002 - Variable to track story time location visits. 13 = completed (TH18 minus 5 PC-98 games).
;CFLAG:1003 - Variable to track story time progress and Aunn's knowledge of Touhou characters. Value directly corresponds with game entry. i.e. Value 6 = Knowledge of events and characters of TH6. Value 8 = Knowledge of events and characters of TH6 - TH8. Theoretically I could use this instead of FIRSTTIME("AunnStoryTimeTHX"), but I like the readability of the former and had not noticed any changes in runtime performance.
;CFLAG:1004 - Flag to track if you touched Aunn's fluffy tail during skinship and are only allowed to do it in private anymore.
;CFLAG:1005 - Used to track sneaking progression in the Lunar Capital (12 or higher will fire the event)
;CFLAG:1006 - Used to track whether Player fucked Aunn behind the tree during the RoL date. Comes up again in the ending. (0 = denied/not yet encountered, 1 = creampied, 2 = condom)
;
;TCVAR:350 - Flag used to only print Christmas event once on Christmas day.
;TCVAR:351 - Flag used to store current position of thighjob ([1 - 4 = Player lead] 1 = legs raised high/knees pushed against chest; 2 = reverse legs raised high; 3 = standing (facing each other), 4 = doggy style (on fours); 5 = doggy style (standing); [6 - 7 = Aunn lead] 6 = sitting facing away from Player; 7 = sitting facing Player;; 0 means no continuity/first action)
